      "text": "Another dedicated ride to LEO is coming soon for @synspective 🦉🛰️ \n\nElectron will lift off this week from Launch Complex 1 to deliver the 12th StriX synthetic aperture radar satellite to space and continue the expansion of their Earth-monitoring constellation.\n\n\"Owl By The Dozen\" launch window opens:\n🚀3:15pm NZST, Sept 19\n🚀03:15 UTC, Sept 19\n🚀12:15 pm JST, Sept 19\n🚀11:15 pm EDT, Sept 18\n🚀8:15 pm PDT, Sept 18",
