      "type": "原文",
      "type_label": "原文",
      "text": "For the first time, we're opening our doors at Wallops Island for an exclusive hiring event at Launch Complexes 2 and 3.\n\nWe welcome engineers and technicians who are exceptionally good at what they do and want to see technology they helped build leave the planet. \n\nAccepted candidates will get the rare opportunity to tour our launch pads and facilities, meet with our engineering teams, and interview one-on-one with department leaders\n\nOpen Positions: \n🔧 Testing Engineers – Vehicle, Avionics, Launch Pad\n🔧 Ground Systems Engineers\n🔧 Vehicle Integration Engineers\n🔧 Mechanical Technicians\n🔧 Senior Vehicle Integration and Test Technicians\n🔧 Fluids Engineers\n🔧 Propulsion Engineers\n\nApply here: https://bit.ly/4xkRE8O",
