      "type": "原文",
      "type_label": "原文",
      "text": "For the last three decades, conventional, multi-junction solar cells have largely relied on germanium wafers.\n\nToday, Rocket Lab announced the production release of IMM Apex, our germanium-free new high-efficiency solar cell to reduce reliance on the supply-constrained critical metals.\n\nRead more here. https://rocketlabcorp.com/updates/rocket-lab-introduces-high-efficiency-solar-cell-to-reduce-reliance-on-supply-constrained-critical-minerals/",
      "quote": null,
      "retweet": null,
