      "created_at_utc": "2026-09-07T02:48:51.000Z",
      "created_at_shanghai": "2026-09-07 10:48:51",
      "type": "原文",
      "type_label": "原文",
      "text": "Rocket Lab has been the sole launch provider for @synspective since 2020, with our 11th Electron mission for them successfully launching last week. \n\nFlying dedicated gives constellation operators like Synspective control over launch schedule, launch site, and orbit, enabling them to deploy their constellation exactly how they want to without compromise. \n\nWe're booked to fly 16 more missions for Synspective to deploy the rest of their constellation, so we're still just warming up! (and we're gonna need more owl themed mission names 🦉)",
      "quote": null,
      "retweet": null,
      "reply_to": "",
